msgid ":mod:`!rlcompleter` --- Completion function for GNU readline"
msgstr ":mod:`!rlcompleter`: kompletteringsfunktion för GNU readline"

msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/rlcompleter.py`"
msgstr "**Källkod:** :source:`Lib/rlcompleter.py`"

msgid ""
"The :mod:`!rlcompleter` module defines a completion function suitable to be "
"passed to :func:`~readline.set_completer` in the :mod:`readline` module."
msgstr ""
"Modulen :mod:`!rlcompleter` definierar en kompletteringsfunktion som kan "
"skickas till :func:`~readline.set_completer` i modulen :mod:`readline`."

msgid ""
"When this module is imported on a Unix platform with the :mod:`readline` "
"module available, an instance of the :class:`Completer` class is "
"automatically created and its :meth:`~Completer.complete` method is set as "
"the :ref:`readline completer <readline-completion>`. The method provides "
"completion of valid Python :ref:`identifiers and keywords <identifiers>`."
msgstr ""
"När den här modulen importeras på en Unixplattform där modulen "
":mod:`readline` är tillgänglig skapas automatiskt en instans av klassen "
":class:`Completer` och dess metod :meth:`~Completer.complete` ställs in som "
":ref:`kompletteringsfunktionen för readline <readline-completion>`. Metoden "
"kompletterar giltiga Python :ref:`identifierare och nyckelord "
"<identifiers>`."

msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Exempel::"

msgid ""
">>> import rlcompleter\n"
">>> import readline\n"
">>> readline.parse_and_bind(\"tab: complete\")\n"
">>> readline. <TAB PRESSED>\n"
"readline.__doc__          readline.get_line_buffer(  readline.read_init_file(\n"
"readline.__file__         readline.insert_text(      readline.set_completer(\n"
"readline.__name__         readline.parse_and_bind(\n"
">>> readline."
msgstr ""
">>> import rlcompleter\n"
">>> import readline\n"
">>> readline.parse_and_bind(\"tab: complete\")\n"
">>> readline. <TAB PRESSED>\n"
"readline.__doc__          readline.get_line_buffer(  readline.read_init_file(\n"
"readline.__file__         readline.insert_text(      readline.set_completer(\n"
"readline.__name__         readline.parse_and_bind(\n"
">>> readline."

msgid ""
"The :mod:`!rlcompleter` module is designed for use with Python's "
":ref:`interactive mode <tut-interactive>`.  Unless Python is run with the "
":option:`-S` option, the module is automatically imported and configured "
"(see :ref:`rlcompleter-config`)."
msgstr ""
"Modulen :mod:`!rlcompleter` är avsedd för användning i Pythons "
":ref:`interaktiva läge <tut-interactive>`. Om Python inte körs med flaggan "
":option:`-S` importeras och konfigureras modulen automatiskt. Se "
":ref:`rlcompleter-config`."

msgid ""
"On platforms without :mod:`readline`, the :class:`Completer` class defined "
"by this module can still be used for custom purposes."
msgstr ""
"På plattformar utan :mod:`readline` kan klassen :class:`Completer`, som "
"definieras av den här modulen, fortfarande användas för egna ändamål."

msgid "Completer objects have the following method:"
msgstr "Completerobjekt har följande metod:"

msgid "Return the next possible completion for *text*."
msgstr "Returnera nästa möjliga komplettering för *text*."

msgid ""
"When called by the :mod:`readline` module, this method is called "
"successively with ``state == 0, 1, 2, ...`` until the method returns "
"``None``."
msgstr ""
"När den anropas av modulen :mod:`readline` anropas den här metoden "
"successivt med ``state == 0, 1, 2, ...`` tills den returnerar ``None``."

msgid ""
"If called for *text* that doesn't include a period character (``'.'``), it "
"will complete from names currently defined in :mod:`__main__`, "
":mod:`builtins` and keywords (as defined by the :mod:`keyword` module)."
msgstr ""
"Om den anropas med *text* som inte innehåller en punkt (``'.'``), "
"kompletteras den med namn som för närvarande har definierats i "
":mod:`__main__`, :mod:`builtins` och med nyckelord enligt modulen "
":mod:`keyword`."

msgid ""
"If called for a dotted name, it will try to evaluate anything without "
"obvious side-effects (functions will not be evaluated, but it can generate "
"calls to :meth:`~object.__getattr__`) up to the last part, and find matches "
"for the rest via the :func:`dir` function.  Any exception raised during the "
"evaluation of the expression is caught, silenced and :const:`None` is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Om den anropas med ett namn som innehåller punkter försöker den utvärdera "
"allt fram till den sista delen utan uppenbara sidoeffekter. Funktioner "
"utvärderas inte, men anrop till :meth:`~object.__getattr__` kan genereras. "
"Matchningar för resten hittas via funktionen :func:`dir`. Alla undantag som "
"utlöses under utvärderingen av uttrycket fångas och tystas, varefter "
":const:`None` returneras."
